01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251027/1059517296348762112730429.png/GnKsqG2PATG1WrYSo_peZ-DXm174bXPliC5ENIguRDQ\"/><figcaption>【影響減肥的11個NG行為】10. 炸物、甜食頻率太高（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"【影響減肥的11個NG行為】10. 炸物、甜食頻率太高（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251027/1059517299050024960109254.png/71myNH6GrrzbmqnR4_e0AFih9P0_nFWStDCjurQwo7o\"/><figcaption>【影響減肥的11個NG行為】10. 炸物、甜食頻率太高（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"【影響減肥的11個NG行為】11. 蔬菜吃太少（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251027/1059517301365411840294701.png/wYTuVhnzyOcrt0XQSNzMSeLQnG3srIoHkUjLsZFIy7E\"/><figcaption>【影響減肥的11個NG行為】11. 蔬菜吃太少（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"【影響減肥的11個NG行為】11. 蔬菜吃太少（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251027/1059517303416557568386247.png/2Ypvy5ZA68OMFE5VsilqCRGYCPFG18qSQDou5kA6LuY\"/><figcaption>【影響減肥的11個NG行為】11. 蔬菜吃太少（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>小黃瓜營養熱量低！營養師揭「6益處」超親民　腎、腸不佳也能吃</p><p>【本文獲「中天新聞網」授權轉載。】</p><p>「本文內容反映原文作者的意見，並不代表《香港01》的立場。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-05T09:19:38.477290+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1763,"images":34,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}